      "source": "Returns a SpEL <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>Expression</code></a> if the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> is actually an expression that does not evaluate to a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/common/LiteralExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.common\"><code>LiteralExpression</code></a> (indicating that no subsequent evaluation is necessary).",
      "translation": "如果给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 实际上是一个表达式，且该表达式不会求值为\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/common/LiteralExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.common\"><code>LiteralExpression</code></a>（表明无需进行后续求值），则返回一个 SpEL <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/Expression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>Expression</code></a>。",
